WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.770
- There is a challenge
online where there are dogs

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.480
that are holding eggs in their mouth.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.950
Like, their mouths are so soft

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.145
and they're such sweet puppies

00:00:09.145 --> 00:00:11.930
that they will hold an
egg without breaking it.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:15.470
Basically, you're challenging
your dog to hold a raw egg

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:17.860
to see if they have a gentle mouth.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.000
So, then you start seeing
a lot of golden retrievers

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.840
doing this egg challenge and passing it.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.730
But then a bunch of other
dog breeds were doing it.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.970
There are a lot of gentle pups out there.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.776
Are you one of them?

00:00:28.776 --> 00:00:33.210
(barking)
(rock music)

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.120
Alright, Lucy, we're gonna try this.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.360
This is an egg, can you
take it in your mouth?

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.980
She's just licking it, okay.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.620
Open your mouth, aah.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.310
No, you're not gonna do it, okay.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:44.070
Maybe we need to practice
with something else.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:44.903
Get the lemon.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:48.593
Okay.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.080
No, you're gonna crack it.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.722
Ready, open your mouth.

00:00:52.722 --> 00:00:54.040
(barking)

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.350
Can you be gentle and pick it up?

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:56.980
No, don't bite.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:59.020
No, it's not gonna happen.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.530
Obviously my dog's not gonna be the one

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:03.445
that's gonna be picking
up an egg any time soon.

00:01:03.445 --> 00:01:04.460
(screams)

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.580
Lucy!

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.850
Why are certain dogs able to
do this and does it really mean

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:09.680
that they're just nicer more gentle dogs?

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:10.983
A lot of dogs fail it.

00:01:10.983 --> 00:01:11.816
(laughing)

00:01:11.816 --> 00:01:12.720
- [Man] He won't take it.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:14.360
He wants nothing to do with the egg.

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.450
- [Woman] Here you go.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:17.130
Ah, ah, ow, ow, no.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:19.380
- I still wanna know why Lucy can't do it

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.770
while all these other dogs can.

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.390
So, I decided to sit
down with a veterinarian

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:26.270
to find out what's going
on with this egg challenge

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:27.540
and what does it really mean?

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:31.110
- The egg challenge is
owners trying to find out

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.340
if their dogs are capable of holding eggs

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:34.550
in their mouths without breaking them.

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:36.147
- It started with golden retrievers.

00:01:36.147 --> 00:01:37.593
- [Man] What's this, how about an egg?

00:01:37.593 --> 00:01:40.901
- They have what's called a soft mouth.

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.080
Take the egg.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:43.990
- Golden retrievers are amazing.

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:45.550
That's what made me become a vet.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:47.800
They are just known to be gentle dogs.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:49.720
Your structure should
determine your function,

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:51.770
and if you just look at the
structure of their body,

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:53.980
their mouths are kind of
shaped in what we call

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.570
a dolicephalic shape.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.450
It's basically an elongated mouth.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.790
So, it's bigger and longer
and it's more capable,

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:01.800
I guess, of holding eggs.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.130
- There are so many Instagrams

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:05.800
of all these different types
of dogs being able to do it.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.300
- But how you look isn't gonna determine

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:10.500
whether you're a gentle
personality or not.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.010
I think a pitbull could totally do this.

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:12.900
They're super gentle.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.970
- But if your dog can't do this...

00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:19.270
- A dog can be the gentlest,
most amazing dog ever

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:21.440
and still not be able to
hold an egg in her mouth.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.637
They might not be as intelligent, perhaps.

00:02:24.637 --> 00:02:26.053
(record scratching)
- Oh my God.

00:02:26.053 --> 00:02:29.357
- Because it might be a matter
of just general training.

00:02:29.357 --> 00:02:30.900
- I could train.
- Yeah.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:31.783
- He can be trained to do it.
- There could be potential

00:02:31.783 --> 00:02:33.630
for anything, don't worry.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.010
- I just don't want you
to call my dog stupid.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:36.960
Because I wanna prove

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:40.070
that she is a smart puppy and also gentle,

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.000
I wanna try the egg
challenge again with Lucy.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.843
I have to sanitize the egg because...

00:02:43.843 --> 00:02:46.420
- Salmonella can live
outside or inside the egg.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:49.410
I've seen videos of an
owner washing the egg

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:50.951
three seconds under running water.

00:02:50.951 --> 00:02:53.410
I don't know if that would do anything.

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:54.990
If you put poop under running water,

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.830
it's probably still dirty.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:59.512
This is what will get me
the most likes on Instagram,

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:02.340
I'm gonna wash it with soap
before giving it to my dog.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:07.070
- So, I'm gonna clean it with
sanitizer and rinse it off.

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:08.760
I've got a sanitized egg

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.210
and now we're gonna try it on Lucy.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.030
Take.
(growling)

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:14.325
Take, take.

00:03:14.325 --> 00:03:15.660
This isn't gonna help.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.660
Lucy, do you wanna try holding the egg?

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.640
I don't think she wants
to do this anymore.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.720
I've been having a lot of trouble.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.150
It's not because she's stupid,
it's because I'm stupid

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:25.360
and I'm bad at training.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:26.760
Do you want it? (gasps)

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:27.600
Oh, (bleep).

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.590
I don't need to prove that
Lucy's a gentle and smart dog

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:33.020
because I know she is,

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.660
but I'm going to prove
that I'm smart enough

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:38.450
to teach her to do the egg challenge.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.530
Why won't you take my egg?

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.420
So, training is not going so well.

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.650
She's like frenemies
with the egg right now

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:45.980
and I need to make her just friends.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:46.830
- Start with treats.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.650
I feel like if you can't
do it with a treat,

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:49.910
they probably can't do it with an egg.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:53.150
- So, see if they can just
hold a treat without eating it?

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:55.610
I'm spreading doggy
peanut butter on the egg.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:57.580
Lucy, you interested in it now?

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:58.600
You gonna lick it?

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.510
Don't you wanna pick up the egg?

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.520
Lucy, take the egg.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.060
She just licked the peanut
butter, so my plan didn't work.

00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:08.260
She's avoiding me and
hiding in her doggy teepee.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:12.720
New strategy, I am going to
try to get her used to the egg.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:14.090
You feelin' better about the eggy?

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:15.203
So, we're getting close.

00:04:15.203 --> 00:04:17.230
Can you take it and hold it?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.850
You put it down right away, okay.

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:20.840
Yay, you did it kind of.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.680
Lucy's now able to hold the egg,

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.730
but she drops it right away.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:29.660
Oh, Lucy, you broke it immediately.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.810
Getting the dog to hold it is one thing

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:33.990
and to keep it in their mouth is another,

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:35.514
probably because she doesn't
want an egg in her mouth

00:04:35.514 --> 00:04:37.764
because who would want
an egg in their mouth?

00:04:38.955 --> 00:04:41.160
Hold it, oh God.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:43.120
Okay, alright, we're getting close.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:43.953
Take.

00:04:45.137 --> 00:04:46.419
Yes!

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:47.861
Yes!

00:04:47.861 --> 00:04:49.470
Oh, that was so good.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:54.400
We finally got Lucy to pass
the egg challenge, like barely.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.610
She heard a sound outside
and got distracted,

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.770
so she got too distracted to drop it.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:00.010
You did it.

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:03.130
I'm proud of you, you actually
did the egg challenge.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.590
You know what, Lucy's not
good at the egg challenge,

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.300
and if she's dropping it it's because

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.932
she's doing it on purpose
'cause she's smart.

00:05:09.932 --> 00:05:12.540
And we know Lucy likes to play basketball,

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.930
so we're gonna see if Lucy
can basketball with the egg.

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:18.480
She can win her own challenges.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.920
Take it.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:20.753
Basket.

00:05:22.564 --> 00:05:25.450
Oh, that was all so perfect.

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.290
Alright, Lucy just...

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:28.980
Whoa, whoa, whoa, no,
no, no, that's raw egg.

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:32.160
Maybe she couldn't quite
pass the egg challenge,

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.260
but she (bleep) nailed
the egg basket challenge.

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:37.590
Look how perfectly that split in half.

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:38.860
I still can't believe it.

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:41.140
We're gonna celebrate
by giving Lucy some eggs

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:43.803
because she deserves it
because she cracked it

00:05:43.803 --> 00:05:48.480
and she's so smart and
I'm so good at training.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:49.553
Take that, vet.

